{"Name":"New Upper Changi Road GLS","ShortName":"New Upper Changi Road GLS","Description":"The Upper Changi Road GLS site spans approximately 340,000 sqft and can yield up to 1,040 units. Located within walking distance of Bedok MRT, the site enjoys strong connectivity \u0026 convenience. As the first new private residential launch in Bedok Central in over 15 years, it\u0027s expected to attract strong interest from homeowners.","StartUrl":"/","Display":"standalone","BackgroundColor":"#ffffff","ThemeColor":"#041e42","Orientation":"portrait","Icons":[{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/23990412-f455-4d15-94f2-a549f043a5a5","Sizes":"192x192","Type":"image/png"},{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/23990412-f455-4d15-94f2-a549f043a5a5","Sizes":"512x512","Type":"image/png"}]}